#NAME "Aurelex Phrasebook"
#INDEX_LANG "en"
#CONTENTS_LANG "en"
good morning
	[m1]a greeting used in the morning[/m]
	[trn]Good morning![/trn]
how are you
	[m1]a friendly inquiry about someone's state[/m]
	[ex]How are you today?[/ex]
thank you
	[m1]a polite expression of gratitude[/m]
	[note]Also: thanks, thanks a lot.[/note]
where is the bathroom
	[m1]asking for the location of a restroom[/m]
